{"channelId":"UCxmEPzxGuomzJBun5uSHSjg","row":["Virbac US",766,"About Virbac\n\nFounded in 1968 by a French veterinarian, Virbac is an independent pharmaceutical laboratory dedicated to animal health, since the beginning. Currently ranked 8th worldwide, the company is present in more than 100 countries, offering a comprehensive and practical range of products and services covering the majority of species and pathologies. Virbac innovation, based on both technological advances and listening to the customers, relies on reactive production facilities which meet the highest international quality standards. For nearly fifty years, these specific features have allowed the company to build a personalized relationship with veterinarians and farmers in every country. Through this privileged partnership, in which social, health and environmental issues come together, Virbac contributes, day after day, to shape the future of animal health.","","United States"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxmEPzxGuomzJBun5uSHSjg","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxmEPzxGuomzJBun5uSHSjg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:54.269Z","channelId":"UCxmEPzxGuomzJBun5uSHSjg","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"fcf83e42da1c798274a0f526c974c8c5a5bd3e1a8612b95999949a31ce46feb8","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"e43d8db0a8784f7fc024a80d7beec118c342fe97e9a0709ff434e0868b885b50"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxmEPzxGuomzJBun5uSHSjg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:54.269Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxmEPzxGuomzJBun5uSHSjg","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":766,"raw":"766 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCxmEPzxGuomzJBun5uSHSjg","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:22:54.269Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":[],"relevantKeywords":[],"priorityKeywords":[],"quality":[{"keyword":"veterinarian"